findings.verify_note:
PPC Land (Jul 9, 2025) confirms:
- the Jul 10, 2025 start;
- public content from professional accounts whose holders are over 18;
- photos, videos, carousels and Reels;
- the toggle under Settings > Privacy.

PPC Land contradicts itself on default-on versus opt-in, and Search Engine World doesn't say, so the user should check the toggle manually. Search Engine World adds that Meta allows indexing of posts uploaded from January 1, 2020 onwards. That date doesn't matter for a new account.
